-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ISHIHARA YOSHIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAKAJIMA DAIJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NIPPON OXYGEN CO LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OHMI TADAHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ISHIHARA, YOSHIO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKAJIMA, DAIJI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NIPPON SANSO CORPORATION</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHMI, TADAHIRO</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ISHIHARA YOSHIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAKAJIMA DAIJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OHMI TADAHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ISHIHARA, YOSHIO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKAJIMA, DAIJI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHMI, TADAHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A system for and a method of producing and supplying highly clean dry air, capable of producing and supplying highly clean dry air at a lower cost in and from a small plant, and being used by effectively circulating the same, the system comprising a clean room provided therein with transfer equipment having a storage and a transfer unit and with treatment equipment, a passage for supplying the highly clean dry air to either one or both of the transfer equipment and treatment equipment, and a passage for circulatingly supplying used highly clean dry air discharged from either one or both of the transfer equipment and treatment equipment to either one or both thereof, the circulating passage being connected to the transfer equipment and storage so as to circulatingly supply the used highly clean dry air therefrom to the storage.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne un système et un procédé de production et de fourniture d'air sec très pur à faible prix de revient. On utilise à cet effet une petite usine de recyclage de l'air. Le système comporte une chambre blanche dans laquelle se trouve un équipement de stockage, une unité de transfert et une unité de traitement. La chambre comporte également une gaine alimentant en air sec très pur l'unité de transfert ou l'unité de traitement; voire les deux. La chambre comporte également une gaine de recyclage de l'air sec très pur fourni tel qu'il est repris au niveau de l'unité de transfert ou de l'unité de traitement, à destination de l'autre ou des deux à la fois. Cette gaine de recyclage est connectée à l'unité de transfert et à l'unité de stockage de façon à recycler vers l'unité de stockage l'air sec très pur de reprise.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>